Nothing needs to be added to .gitignore since the changes only include HTML template files which are source files and not build artifacts, dependencies, or temporary files.
```
# Compiled Python files
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd

# Build and distribution artifacts
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/

# Logs
*.log

# Environment files
.env
.env.local
*.env.*
.env.*
.venv/
venv/
ENV/

# IDE
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*.tmp

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Coverage
.coverage
coverage/
htmlcov/

# Testing
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
